{"speciesId":411,"names":{"fr":"Bastiodon","es":"Bastiodon","en":"Bastiodon","ja":"トリデプス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokémon that feeds on grass and berries."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When attacked, they form a wall with their shieldlike faces to protect their young."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When attacked, they form a wall. Their rock-hard faces serve to protect them from the attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When attacked, they form a wall. Their rock-hard faces serve to protect them from the attacks."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En groupe, ils protègent leurs petits en formant autour d’eux une impénétrable muraille."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En groupe, ils protègent leurs petits en formant autour d’eux une impénétrable muraille."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"En groupe, ils protègent leurs petits en formant autour d’eux une impénétrable muraille."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se alineaban y creaban una barrera que ningún enemigo podía cruzar. Así protegían a sus crías."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"横一列に 並ぶと どんな ポケモンでも 突破 できない。 そうやって 子供を 守っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il résiste à toute attaque frontale. C’est un Pokémon docile qui se nourrit d’herbe et de Baies."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Repele cualquier ataque frontal. Es muy dócil y se alimenta de hierba y bayas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokémon that feeds on grass and berries."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"正面からの 攻撃は すべて 跳ね返す。草や 木の実を 食べる おとなしい 性格。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En groupe, ils protègent leurs petits en formant autour d’eux une impénétrable muraille."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se alineaban y creaban una barrera que ningún enemigo podía cruzar. Así protegían a sus crías."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"横一列に 並ぶと どんな ポケモンでも 突破 できない。 そうやって 子供を 守っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il résiste à toute attaque frontale. C’est un Pokémon docile qui se nourrit d’herbe et de Baies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Repele cualquier ataque frontal. Es muy dócil y se alimenta de hierba y bayas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokémon that feeds on grass and berries."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"正面からの 攻撃は すべて 跳ね返す。草や 木の実を 食べる おとなしい 性格。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"S’il peut parer quasiment tous les assauts de face, il est extrêmement vulnérable aux attaques par-derrière."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es capaz de repeler cualquier ataque frontal, pero se encuentra totalmente a merced de los ataques por la retaguardia."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"While it can guard against any sort of attack from the front, it is left without recourse when attacked from behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"正面からで あれば あらゆる 攻撃を ガードできるが 後ろを 取られると なす術なし。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il vivait dans les mêmes zones que le Charkos. On trouve parfois leurs fossiles embrassés pour l’éternité suite à un K.O. mutuel."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Compartía hábitat con Rampardos. A veces se han encontrado fósiles de ambas especies yaciendo juntos tras una lucha encarnizada."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It lived in the same environments as Rampardos. Their fossils have been found together— seemingly from after they’d fought to the finish."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ラムパルドと 似た 場所に いた。 ２匹が 争い 共倒れに なった 化石が 見つかることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Jusqu’à ce qu’on reconstitue ce Pokémon avec succès, on prenait les grands os solides qui couvrent son visage pour sa colonne vertébrale."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Hasta que no se regeneró por completo a este Pokémon, se pensaba que los grandes y recios huesos de su rostro eran su columna vertebral."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The bones of its face are huge and hard, so they were mistaken for its spine until after this Pokémon was successfully restored."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"顔の骨が でかくて 硬いので 復元が 成功するまで 背骨と 勘違い されていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon éteint depuis environ 100 millions d’années. Sa tête incroyablement solide était plus dure que l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon con una antigüedad de unos cien millones de años. Su rostro posee una dureza impresionante, superior incluso a la del acero."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon is from roughly 100 million years ago. Its terrifyingly tough face is harder than steel."},{